{"id":"wb-3-10","name":"李大钊故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李大钊故居 (乐亭)","text":"李大钊故居位于河北省乐亭县大黑坨村，建于1881年。故居分为前中后三院，为冀东农村地区典型的穿堂院式建筑。中国共产党早期领导人李大钊诞生于此。现为全国重点文物保护单位。\n另外，河北省乐亭县新城区还建有李大钊纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E5%A4%A7%E9%92%8A%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85_(%E4%B9%90%E4%BA%AD)","revisionId":92021421,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021421","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fb83ed0925dcce625f70f7f2.jpg","title":"交通大学唐山学校.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%94%90%E5%B1%B1%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%94%90%E5%B1%B1%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"摄影者不详","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"交通大学唐山学校","width":320,"height":199,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}